  "notes": [
    "Official English base rules (2020-10-03); expansion components and 5th player are excluded.",
    "The game has no fixed physical board. The SVG is an original, text-free tabletop map for the full shared supply and 2–4 reusable player seats; it is not a reproduction of the commercial art.",
    "Areas are free-placement regions; the exact card/component identity, owner, turned state, face, private visibility, and attached essence piles live in tableModel rather than fixed slots.",
    "The shared essence bank and First Player token are drawn as geometry because the current runtime component-catalog binding does not expose a public essence-supply/token area; tableModel retains their state contract for a later consumer.",
    "No application integration or rule engine is included in this asset package."
  ],
